`,depth:1,text:"Cell Sizing",tokens:[{type:"text",raw:"Cell Sizing",text:"Cell Sizing",escaped:!1}]},{type:"paragraph",raw:"Calculates one dimensions object for React and CSS. A glyph is 9 by 16 source pixels. Cell height is the smaller whole-pixel height that fits the target 21 columns or 20 rows; cell width keeps the font's aspect ratio.",text:"Calculates one dimensions object for React and CSS. A glyph is 9 by 16 source pixels. Cell height is the smaller whole-pixel height that fits the target 21 columns or 20 rows; cell width keeps the font's aspect ratio.",tokens:[{type:"text",raw:"Calculates one dimensions object for React and CSS. A glyph is 9 by 16 source pixels. Cell height is the smaller whole-pixel height that fits the target 21 columns or 20 rows; cell width keeps the font's aspect ratio.",text:"Calculates one dimensions object for React and CSS. A glyph is 9 by 16 source pixels. Cell height is the smaller whole-pixel height that fits the target 21 columns or 20 rows; cell width keeps the font's aspect ratio.",escaped:!1}]},{type:"space",raw:`

