`,depth:1,text:"Minimap Data",tokens:[{type:"text",raw:"Minimap Data",text:"Minimap Data",escaped:!1}]},{type:"paragraph",raw:"Creates one native Island and prepares exploration using the game's playable path matrix, pathfinder, entity movement and visibility system. Routes visit Earth Town, Fire Haven and the Nomad. The final viewpoint lies on the explored route away from POI markers. Unexplored fog remains; each zoom uses the same hero, world and exploration state.",text:"Creates one native Island and prepares exploration using the game's playable path matrix, pathfinder, entity movement and visibility system. Routes visit Earth Town, Fire Haven and the Nomad. The final viewpoint lies on the explored route away from POI markers. Unexplored fog remains; each zoom uses the same hero, world and exploration state.",tokens:[{type:"text",raw:"Creates one native Island and prepares exploration using the game's playable path matrix, pathfinder, entity movement and visibility system. Routes visit Earth Town, Fire Haven and the Nomad. The final viewpoint lies on the explored route away from POI markers. Unexplored fog remains; each zoom uses the same hero, world and exploration state.",text:"Creates one native Island and prepares exploration using the game's playable path matrix, pathfinder, entity movement and visibility system. Routes visit Earth Town, Fire Haven and the Nomad. The final viewpoint lies on the explored route away from POI markers. Unexplored fog remains; each zoom uses the same hero, world and exploration state.",escaped:!1}]},{type:"space",raw:`

